  "ingredients": [
    "20 ounce boneless, skinless chicken breast",
    "4 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "2 tablespoon mayonnaise",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1/2 cup cheddar cheese (shredded)",
    "1/2 cup parmesan cheese (shredded)",
    "8 ounce fresh artichoke (chopped)",
    "4 ounce frozen spinach (chopped)",
    "1 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "3 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 tablespoon apple cider vinegar",
    "1 teaspoon dijon mustard",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "20 ounce romaine lettuce (chopped)",
    "12 medium cherry tomatoes (quartered)",
    "1/2 medium red onion (sliced)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prepare all the ingredients. Preheat oven to 375F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease a baking dish with olive oil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine the softened cream cheese, mayonnaise, minced garlic, cheddar and parmesan cheese, artichokes, spinach, & crushed red pepper flakes. Mix until combined well. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "With a knife, slice the chicken breast on one side just enough so it does not cut through the chicken but large enough so it will hold the spinach and artichoke filling.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a spoon, spoon the spinach and artichoke filling into the chicken breast.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Evenly line the stuffed chicken breasts in a baking dish.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle olive oil on top of the chicken breasts. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the oven for 25 minutes or until the chicken reaches 165F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, make the vinaigrette by combining the olive oil, apple cider vinegar, dijon mustard, and salt and pepper. Stir until combined well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together the romaine lettuce, cherry tomatoes, and onions for the salad and toss it in the vinaigrette.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Spinach-and-Artichoke-Stuffed-Chicken-Breast-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plate the chicken and salad. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-artichoke-stuffed-chicken-breast/#wprm-recipe-53733-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
